# FOMO dashboard

- Never ship mock PnL as a fallback once live sources are configured. Degrade to wallet-only + warnings.
- A load where neither FOMO nor on-chain answered must not touch the local peak/equity log (it caused a fake -100% drawdown). Wallets resolved once are cached in the browser config.
- FOMO trades land on Robinhood chain via Relay; the Solana wallet is usually just USDC in/out. Relay's public API (api.relay.link/requests/v2?user=<sol wallet>) gives buys/sells with amountUsdCurrent and the EVM recipient — use it before paid FOMO endpoints. It rate-limits (429); page with backoff.
- FOMO wallet resolution costs 2,500 credits — cache the profile when adding refresh timers.
- Positions endpoint is the source for open/closed trades; `/trades` is deprecated.
- Cash = SOL + stables. Don't put USDC in the open-risk table.
- Keep FOMO_API_KEY on the server (`x-fomo-api-key` from the UI is OK). Do not prefix it with VITE_ for production.
- Vercel Node functions in /api cannot import src/*.ts (FUNCTION_INVOCATION_FAILED). Change server/vercel-portfolio.ts or server/vercel-chat.ts and run npm run build:api so api/portfolio.js and api/chat.js stay the bundled entries (node_modules stay external).
- Desk chat is JSON POST /api/chat (generateText, not streaming). LLM keys: LLM_API_KEY / AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY on the server, or x-llm-api-key from Sources. Default model gpt-5.4. Never commit keys.
- FOMO tape is often empty or stale. Overlay spotlight + Relay cost basis onto the wallet, Dex 24h when there is no entry, and never fake $0 unrealized as a real P&L.
- Scanner: /api/plays (server/vercel-plays.ts → api/plays.js) never loads the portfolio — it rebuilds a book-free runner board from the live tape (Dex boosts + profiles + Gecko new_pools page 1, trending only as tie-break; 12s tape cache; ≤30-mint Dex pair batch per rebuild). The page applies held mints, book fit, vetoes and caps from the snapshot already on screen (applyBook). The Scanner's only timer polls /api/plays every 20s; never put /api/portfolio on a timer. Cards never carry buy/sell/sign actions; any book veto makes every card watch with cap 0.
- Scanner cards rank by runnerScore (fresh/early/buyers/exit/wash) and ignore the book; the book only flips watch vs size and its veto is shown once in the tab header, never on cards. Drop pairs older than 48h. Never derive market cap from FDV.
